  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Updated JDI Implementation Plan 2020-2025 and RENAMI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Peru&apos;s updated Implementation Plan under the Joint Declaration of Intent for the period 2020-2025. The objective of the implementation plan is to reduce deforestation in the Peruvian Amazon through strengthened land use, community forest management, various conservation schemes, agroforestry, strengthening of Indigenous People&apos;s rights, actions to reduce illegal activities etc. The support will be managed through a dedicated financial mechanism for REDD+. In addition, the programme will support a participatory consultation process related to the establishment of a national register for greenhous gas emissions in Peru (RENAMI).</narrative>
  </description>
